              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lvnthktchn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Not a fan of raw celery, so I left it out and didn't miss it. Used food processor to grate all veggies quickly. A fabulous slaw!",
            "datePublished": "2011-07-31T15:05:52.983Z"
