            },
            "reviewBody": "very easy to make and very tasty! I bought some kohlrabi and couldn't decide between making a salad/slaw or cooking/roasting them. since it's getting warm outside, i made this slaw. i enjoy it a lot and made just half recipe for now since no one else in my house will eat slaw. used purple cabbage since that's what i had and it was just fine",
